# Project Context - FastSourcingBrothers

## Stack
- Laravel 11+ (PHP 8.3), Livewire, Blade, Tailwind CSS
- MySQL, Redis (cache/queue), Laravel Horizon
- DomPDF, Imagick, Firebase FCM, Google Sheets API, Lark Sheets API

## Domain
B2B sourcing platform: clients submit sourcing requests, admins create quotations, clients accept/reject, orders are tracked with FSB virtual tracking numbers, shipped via shipping companies, synced to Lark/Google Sheets.

## Key Entities
- `SourcingRequest` -> `Quotation` -> `SourcingOrder` (main workflow)
- `SourcingOrder` has destinations, shipments, media, refund requests
- `ShippingCompany` linked to Lark/Google sheet integration
- FSB tracking: virtual tracking numbers per destination (format: `FSB` + padded ID)

## Architecture Target (Repository-Service-Controller)
- **Controllers**: validate input (FormRequest), delegate to service, return response
- **Services** (`app/Services/`): all business logic lives here
- **Repositories** (`app/Repositories/`): data access only (Eloquent queries)
- **Models**: relationships, accessors, casts, constants only
- **Listeners**: delegate to services, no inline business logic

## Roles
- `super_admin`, `admin`, `developer`, `client`

